<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Form 4852</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 5px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-section {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 12pt;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .form-label {
    font-weight: bold;
    display: inline-block;
    width: 150px; /* Adjust as needed for alignment */
  }
  .input-area {
    border-bottom: 1px solid black;
    min-width: 200px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .checkbox-group label {
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .signature-box {
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
  }
  .signature-line {
    border-top: 1px solid black;
    width: 200px;
    padding-top: 5px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .instructions-box {
    margin-top: 30px;
    padding: 15px;
    border: 1px solid #ccc;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div>
      <h1 style="font-size: 16pt; margin: 0;">Form 4852</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 5px 0 0 0;">(Rev. Aug 2013)</p>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin: 0;">OMB No. 1545-0074</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">[ ]</span> Substitute for Form W-2, Wage and Tax Statement, or Form 1099-R, Distributions From Pensions, Annuities, Retirement or Profit-Sharing Plans, IRAs, Insurance Contracts, etc.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">[ ]</span> Attach to Form 1040, 1040A, 1040EZ, or 1040X.
    </p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">
      <span style="font-weight: bold;">[ ]</span> Information about Form 4852 is available at www.irs.gov/form4852.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <div>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">1 Name(s) shown on return</p>
        <div class="input-area" style="width: 50%;">
          <span data-field="full_name">{{ taxpayer_full_name }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">2 Your social security number</p>
        <div class="input-area" style="width: 200px;">
          <span data-field="ssn">{{ taxpayer_ssn }}</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">3 Address</p>
      <div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="taxpayer_address">{{ taxpayer_address }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">4 Enter year in space provided and check one box. For the tax year ending December 31,</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 10px;">
        <span style="font-weight: bold;">[ ]</span> Form W-2 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="font-weight: bold;">[ ]</span> Form 1099-R.
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 10px;">I have notified the IRS of this fact. The amounts shown on line 7 or line 8 are my best estimates for all wages or payments made to me and tax withheld by my employer or payer named on line 5.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">5 Employer's or payer's name, address, and ZIP code</p>
      <div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">
        <span data-field="employer.name">{{ employer.name }}</span>
        <br>
        <span data-field="employer.address">{{ employer.address }}</span>
        <span data-field="employer.zip">{{ employer.zip }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">7 Form W-2. Enter wages, tips, other compensation, and taxes withheld.</h2>
    <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 5%;">a</th>
          <th style="width: 45%;">Description</th>
          <th style="width: 5%;">g</th>
          <th style="width: 45%;">State income tax withheld</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>a</td>
          <td><span data-field="w2_a_description">{{ w2_a_description }}</span></td>
          <td>g</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ w2_g_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>b</td>
          <td><span data-field="w2_b_description">{{ w2_b_description }}</span></td>
          <td>h</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ w2_h_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>c</td>
          <td><span data-field="w2_c_description">{{ w2_c_description }}</span></td>
          <td>i</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ w2_i_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>d</td>
          <td><span data-field="w2_d_description">{{ w2_d_description }}</span></td>
          <td>j</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ w2_j_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>e</td>
          <td><span data-field="w2_e_description">{{ w2_e_description }}</span></td>
          <td>k</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ w2_k_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>f</td>
          <td><span data-field="w2_f_description">{{ w2_f_description }}</span></td>
          <td>l</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ w2_l_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">8 Form 1099-R. Enter distributions from pensions, annuities, retirement/profit-sharing plans, IRAs, insurance contracts, etc.</h2>
    <table style="font-size: 10pt;">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 5%;">a</th>
          <th style="width: 45%;">Description</th>
          <th style="width: 5%;">f</th>
          <th style="width: 45%;">Federal income tax withheld</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>a</td>
          <td><span data-field="r1099_a_description">{{ r1099_a_description }}</span></td>
          <td>f</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ r1099_f_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>b</td>
          <td><span data-field="r1099_b_description">{{ r1099_b_description }}</span></td>
          <td>g</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ r1099_g_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>c</td>
          <td><span data-field="r1099_c_description">{{ r1099_c_description }}</span></td>
          <td>h</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ r1099_h_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>d</td>
          <td><span data-field="r1099_d_description">{{ r1099_d_description }}</span></td>
          <td>i</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ r1099_i_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>e</td>
          <td><span data-field="r1099_e_description">{{ r1099_e_description }}</span></td>
          <td>j</td>
          <td><div class="input-area" style="width: 100%;">{{ r1099_j_amount }}</div></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">9 How did you determine the amounts on lines 7 and 8 above?</h2>
    <div class="input-area" style="width: 100%; height: 80px; border: 1px solid black;">
      <span data-field="explanation_9">{{ explanation_9 }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">10 Explain your efforts to obtain Form W-2, Form 1099-R, or Form W-2c, Corrected Wage and Tax Statement.</h2>
    <div class="input-area" style="width: 100%; height: 150px; border: 1px solid black;">
      <span data-field="explanation_10">{{ explanation_10 }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-box">
    <div>
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Sign Here</p>
      <div class="signature-line">
        <span data-field="signature_name">{{ signature_name }}</span>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 5px;">Signature</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p style="font-weight: bold;">Date</p>
      <div class="signature-line" style="width: 150px;">
        <span data-field="signature_date">{{ signature_date }}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start;">
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">General Instructions</h2>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Section references are to the Internal Revenue Code.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Future developments. The IRS has created a page on IRS.gov for information about Form 4852, at www.irs.gov/form4852. Information about Form 4852 is subject to change without notice. The legislation enacted after we release it will be posted on that page.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Purpose of form. Form 4852 serves as a substitute for Forms W-2, W-2c, and 1099-R and is completed by you or your representatives when you do not receive these forms. The IRS does not list income on Form 1099-R or be an employer or payer has issued an incorrect Form W-2 or Form 1099-R. Attach this form to the back of your tax return.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">You should always attempt to get Form W-2, Form W-2c, or Form 1099-R from your employer or payer before contacting the IRS or to have the IRS do so for you. Do not make the IRS do this for you. Contact your employer or payer by February 14, you may call the IRS at 1-800-829-1040 for assistance. You must provide your name, address (including ZIP code), phone number, social security number, and employer's or payer's name.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">name, address (including ZIP code), and phone number. The IRS will contact your employer or payer and request the missing form. If you do not receive the form, you may use the Form 4852 that the IRS sent you.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you received an incorrect Form W-2 or Form 1099-R, you should contact your employer or payer or issue a corrected form before filing Form 4852.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Note. Return a copy of Form 4852 for your records. To help protect your privacy, do not send a copy of Form 4852 to the IRS. Keep a copy of the form for your records.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you have questions about your work and/or earnings in a particular tax year, you may call the IRS at 1-800-829-1040. You may use a Social Security online account to verify wages reported by your employers. Please visit www.ssa.gov/myaccount.</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you have questions about your local SSA office to verify wages reported by your employer.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
    <h2 style="font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">Will I need to amend my return?</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">If you receive a Form W-2, Form W-2c, or Form 1099-R after your return is filed with Form 4852, and the information differs from the information reported on your return,</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">you must file an amended return.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="instructions-box">
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Paperwork Reduction Act Notice. See page 2.</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Form 4852 (Rev. 8-2013)</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>